    "text": "For a chemical reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Product, the order is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> with respect to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>.<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Rate</strong><br />\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>[A]</strong><br />\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>[B]</strong><br />\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>40</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>80</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>What is the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>?</p>"
